@id=explore-the-graph-in-a-browser @maturity=draft
Feature: Explore the graph in a browser

  Stakeholders who do not live in a terminal want to read the graph too: the curated architecture,
  the way from a requirement to its decisions and code, the lifecycle chart. Today they have
  nowhere to read it but the files and the commands.

  Rule: A reader browses the architecture as sdp arch shows it

  Rule: A reader follows a requirement to its decisions and its code

  Rule: A reader sees the lifecycle chart

  @decided-by:files-are-the-source-of-truth
  Rule: The explorer only reads: an edit is made in the files
